# Normalize every text file to LF, regardless of what line ending it has on whatever machine last touched it.
# This repo has no core.autocrlf set, so WSL/Windows tooling can flip a file to CRLF on disk while git's stored
# blob stays LF; git status then shows a false "modified" even though the content is byte-identical. See CLAUDE.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Genuinely binary — never touched by the text normalization above.
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff2 binary
